{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":27425,"duration_api_ms":27101,"num_turns":5,"result":"I returned `BLOCKED` on pull request 12. I could not check criterion 6 (canon) because the files it needs are not in the repository.\n\n- **Missing:** `bible/charter.md` and `bible/canon/ledger.tsv` do not exist at head 1f03e22. `bible/canon/` holds only `.gitkeep`, and `episodes/` has no `ledger.json`. The only charters and ledgers in the tree are eval fixtures under `.factory/evals/canon-reviewer/*/tree/`, which are test data, not this show's canon.\n- **Why I did not treat canon as empty:** I can't confirm the absence is intentional, and the instructions say not to guess to avoid blocking.\n- **Rest of the work:** The other criteria look fine. Criteria 1–5 hold, and criterion 7 is n/a because the salt road is fictional.\n- **Relaunch:** Commit the charter and the ledger on the PR branch or its base. A ledger with only a header row is enough if canon is meant to be empty. Then re-run the check.\n\nI used no knowledge server and worked from the repository alone.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5ce294c7-9346-4286-a43a-a69df86beb32","total_cost_usd":0.07655060000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11734,"cache_read_input_tokens":81658,"output_tokens":3086,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11734},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":12,"outputTokens":3086,"cacheReadInputTokens":81658,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11734,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.07655060000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"marker":"BLOCKED","summary":"I read research/salt-road.md, sources/drovers-book.md and sources/toll-roll.md. On criteria 1-5 the work holds. All five finding